00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:56.399
Jonas and bring him to their world in
one reality, and having alt Bartosz stop

00:01:56.399 --> 00:02:01.020
Martha and bring her back in another. This
creates the situation where Jonas and

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:05.700
Martha are existing in two realities at
the same time and ensures their child

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:10.560
