Claudia learned this as she was trying

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:23.980
to figure out a way to save her daughter
Regina who dies in both of their worlds.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:28.300
Where Jonas and Martha's son turns out
to be the thing that keeps the loop

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:33.280
