Tannhaus trying to save his family with

00:02:43.569 --> 00:02:48.250
time travel in a third world - the actual
origin world. we've been talking about

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:52.870
prime world, it turns out that neither of
those are the real world.

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:57.160
Claudia figured out that things are
deterministic in the worlds we've seen

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:02.230
