00:03:29.829 --> 00:03:34.060
there's no alt Marta coming to save him.
He then explains that there is a way

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:37.510
that Jonas can stop himself from
becoming Adam.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:42.940
Jonas has to go to Eva's world and save
Martha from the apocalypse before Magnus

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:47.709
and Franziska do. he's able to do this in
dramatic fashion grabbing her at the

00:03:47.709 --> 00:03:53.980
last second and taking her to June 21st
1986. that's the day the passage was

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:59.950
first opened, and when Adam and Eva's
worlds were created. as mentioned the

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:04.540
original world Tannhaus created a time
machine trying to prevent a car crash

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:10.000
which kills his family. in that process
