00:04:15.489 --> 00:04:19.900
a short period of time as the passage is
being created. they can use that to

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.750
travel to the origin world on
day of the car-crash to prevent it from

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:27.770
happening. they're transported from the
cave onto the bridge and thus there's a

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:33.170
